  "steps": [
    "In a bowl, mix the paneer with the ginger-garlic paste, corn flour, black pepper powder, chilli flakes, 2 tbsp soy sauce and salt until evenly coated.",
    "Heat the ghee in a pan on medium heat.",
    "Add the coated paneer, keeping the pieces spaced apart.",
    "Cook for about 5 minutes until golden and crispy, then set aside.",
    "In the same pan, add the butter, chopped garlic and green garlic shoots and sauté well.",
    "Add 1 tbsp soy sauce, the black pepper and the fresh cream, and mix well.",
    "Pour in the milk and let the sauce cook for about 2 minutes until creamy.",
    "Put the crispy paneer back in.",
    "Add the chopped coriander and the honey, mix, and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Turn off the heat, drizzle over the chilli oil, give it a final mix and serve."
  ],
